"summary": "Get ready for the biggest party yet in Super Mario Party Jamboree for Nintendo Switch. From running through merry-go-rounds to motion-control minigolf, this jamboree is jam-packed with over 110 minigames \u2013 the most of any Mario Party game to date!\n\nWith seven boards in all, you can go with the flow in Goomba Lagoon, search for stars in Rainbow Galleria, revisit the classics of Western Land and Mario\u2019s Rainbow Castle from past titles and more.\n\nRace across the party board in Koopathlon, a series-first 20-player online competition to see who can rack up the highest scores in minigames like the fast-paced Lane Change. The higher your score in each round, the faster you\u2019ll get to the goal. Koopathlon is just one of a slew of additional modes \u2013 there\u2019s something for every kind of Mario Party player to enjoy!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/super-mario-party-jamboree", "videos": [{"id": 116685, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "lKp9cD4e8ac", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lKp9cD4e8ac", "title": "Super Mario Party Jamboree \u2013 Announcement Trailer \u2013 Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lKp9cD4e8ac/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 131060, "name": "Overview Trailer", "video_id": "YKR6sdcO4ac", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YKR6sdcO4ac", "title": "Super Mario Party Jamboree \u2013 Overview Trailer \u2013 Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YKR6sdcO4ac/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 131061, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "sZNeut6RR4I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZNeut6RR4I", "title": "Super Mario Party Jamboree \u2014 Launch Trailer \u2014 Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sZNeut6RR4I/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 10065, "name": "Super Mario Party"}, {"id": 453, "name": "Mario Party"}]}